Package: lan-share
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lan-Share Developers <devs@lan-share.local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pil, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-tk
Recommends: network-manager
Suggests: git
Description: screen sharing across your LAN
 Lan-Share is a lightweight relay-based screen sharing tool for a local
 network. One PC runs the relay server and shares its screen; other PCs
 on the same LAN discover it and either share their own screen or watch
 any active session - all inside the LAN, no internet required.
 .
 This package installs:
   * lan-share        - native GTK3 desktop app (share / watch / list)
   * lan-share-gui    - browser-based control panel
   * lan-share-relay  - relay server control window
   * lan-share-server - headless relay daemon
   * a systemd unit (lan-share-relay.service) for running the relay on boot
 .
 Screen frames are captured with Pillow and relayed over a tiny custom
 TCP protocol on port 8501 (discovery on UDP 8502).
